      <h1 class="lines"><span class="line"><span data-line style="--i:1">Dental Check-up in Deira</span></span></h1>
      <p class="phero__lead" data-rise style="--i:3">A dental check-up looks at the health of your teeth, gums and mouth. At Pearlecent in Al Rigga, your first general dental consultation is free.</p>
      <p class="hero__btns land-btns" data-rise style="--i:4"><a class="button button--lg" href="#book">Book appointment<svg class="arr" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/></svg></a><a class="button button--lg button--soft" href="https://wa.me/971553396152?text=Hello%20Pearlecent%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20ask%20about%20Dental%20Check-up." target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-lead-type="Treatment enquiry" data-lead-treatment="Dental Check-up">Chat with us</a><a class="button button--lg button--outline" href="tel:+971553396152">Call +971 55 339 6152</a></p>
